Third-party lineage:

- The animation math (per-line delay, short-scroll stretch, easing curves) and the configuration
  option names are ported from azorng/tmux-smooth-scroll (MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 azorng), the tmux
  plugin this repository was asked to model.
- The repository layout, Unix-socket client conventions, and the isolated PTY lab harness follow
  Leewonchan14/herdr-flash (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 WonChan Lee).
